---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy - WW AI Scorer" 
  description="Privacy Policy for WW AI Scorer (ww-extension)"
>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 pt-16 md:pt-20 pb-24">
    <header class="mb-14">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="w-8 md:w-12 h-px bg-orange-900/30"></div>
        <span class="text-[10px] md:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-orange-900/60 font-sans font-semibold">Legal —</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-stone-900 font-serif leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-4">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-400 font-sans text-sm tracking-wide">
        Last Updated: May 21, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-stone prose-lg max-w-none 
      prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-stone-900
      prose-p:text-stone-700 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:font-serif prose-p:text-lg md:prose-p:text-xl
      prose-a:text-orange-900 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline
      prose-strong:text-stone-900">
      
      <h2>Privacy Policy for WW AI Scorer (ww-extension)</h2>

      <h3>1. Data Collection</h3>
      <p>
        This extension does not collect, transmit, distribute, or store any personal user data on developer servers or any third-party servers.
      </p>

      <h3>2. API Key Security</h3>
      <p>
        This extension utilizes a "Bring Your Own Key" (BYOK) model. Users must provide their own Google Gemini API key. This key is stored securely and strictly within the user's browser local storage (<code>chrome.storage.local</code>). The developer has no access to this key.
      </p>

      <h3>3. Data Processing</h3>
      <p>
        Job descriptions extracted from WaterlooWorks and the user's profile data are sent directly to the Google Gemini API to generate job-fit scores. No data is intercepted, processed, or retained by the extension's developer.
      </p>

      <h3>4. Contact</h3>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can reach out via GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/hyoseo837/ww-extension" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://github.com/hyoseo837/ww-extension</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
